<title>SPAIN: Spain's Cortefiel 1996/1997 net up 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Cortefiel 1996/1997 net up 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Group results for calendar year 1996 ending on February 28, 1997, in billion of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Net profit			   4.15     vs    3.46</p>
<p> Cash Flow			    7.01     vs    5.78</p>
<p> Turnover			    68.83     vs   59.68</p>
<p>NOTE - The company's net taxed had falled 22 percent in the calendar year 1995. Cortefiel said it had 356 clothing stores at the end of February, 51 more than one year before.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
